Package: 3d-for-luanti Version: 1.0.0 Section: graphics Priority: optional Architecture: all Depends: python3, python3-webview, python3-gi, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1 Maintainer: serfdon serfdon@localhost Description: Lightweight 3D voxel and low-poly modeler for Luanti Create 16x16x16 node-based 3D models within a 3x2x3 node workspace for Luanti. Supports boxes, rotated cuboids, cylinders, cones, and UV spheres with pixel snapping, copy/paste, Luanti 65,535-vertex engine guardrails, and direct export to Luanti Nodebox Lua (.lua), Wavefront (.obj), and glTF (.glb).